From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:23:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] CaptureService: serve every continuous request and the newest
 shot

The service served one request per frame, the newest. A second
continuous capture got no frames while another ran, and a one-shot
submitted under a continuous one waited until that ended.
---
